{"id":879836,"title":"16｜安装Docker","content":"在服务器上安装Docker以部署Dify应用的过程中，首先需开启网络加速功能来提高下载速度。通过文档中心找到学术资源加速选项，并根据提示选择合适的命令进行设置。确认系统中尚未安装Docker后，按照官方指南为Ubuntu系统添加Docker源并更新软件包列表。接着执行特定命令一次性安装Docker及其Compose工具。每一步操作均需严格按照指示完成，确保Docker及相关组件正确安装。最后，使用`docker ps`和`docker compose`命令验证安装成功。整个过程强调了遵循官方指导的重要性，以保证私有化部署顺利进行。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":400582,"user_name":"人生几度秋凉","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1149080,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"796591E35991BA","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/88/98/7bcd7183.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1748391297,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":145511,"content":"https:&#47;&#47;jinshuju.com&#47;f&#47;Wjxbiv 通过这个进群","user_name":"编辑回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1501385,"ctime":1748398312,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":400582,"utype":2}],"discussion_count":3,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"咱们这个课程有群么？如何获取相关课件和文档？谢谢","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1501385,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/e8/c9/59bcd490.jpg","nickname":"听水的湖","note":"","ucode":"B1759F90165D81","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":661617,"discussion_content":"https://jinshuju.com/f/Wjxbiv 通过这个进群","content_length":36,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1748398312,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":8,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":2,"child_discussions":[{"author":{"id":1056192,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/1d/c0/ab9b24d8.jpg","nickname":"favoorr","note":"","ucode":"E83A360B332BCC","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":1501385,"avatar":"https://static001.ge